.env.*.local
# Prisma CLI (migrate/studio/generate) only auto-loads a file named exactly
# `.env` from the schema's own directory -- it does not read the repo-root
# `.env.local` NestJS's ConfigModule uses. This local-only copy exists
# purely so `prisma migrate`/`prisma studio` work without manually
# exporting DATABASE_URL first; never commit real credentials here.
/apps/backend/prisma/.env
